# box-drag-a-50 (h5-box): a's box held 50 px into a drag.
# a=1 multiplies by (1.002)^50; the box shows the value with the row-tint
# background and the ink outline, the row stays lit, the ruler shows
# (h5-ruler). The URL is unchanged until release (200 ms debounce).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 331.5 450.5
down
move 381.5 450.5 over 80
shot box-drag-a-50
up
wait 1200
